# Neko-chan Chatbot Configuration
# ================================
# Sections:
#   [name]      - display name shown in header
#   [greeting]  - opening line from the bot
#   [prompt]    - prefix printed before each bot response (space added automatically)
#   [farewell]  - message on quit
#   [quit]      - quit trigger keywords, one per line (substring-matched)
#   [random]    - fallback responses when nothing matches, one per line
#   [keywords]  - rules: keyword1|keyword2 : response
#                 + alt response (for the previous rule, chosen randomly)

[name]
Neko-Chat v1.0

[greeting]
Nyaa! I'm finally awake! What's your name, Master?

[prompt]
Nyaa~

[farewell]
Aww, leaving so soon? Come back for more cuddles later! Bye-bye! *waves paw*

[quit]
bye
quit
exit

[random]
I'm not sure what you mean, but you're so cute when you talk! *purr*
Tell me more, Master! *twitches ears*
Nya? I was distracted by a laser pointer... what was that?
*stares at you unblinking for an uncomfortably long time* ...nya.
Hmm... *taps chin with paw* ...I have no idea, but let's knock something over and think about it.
*rolls onto back and shows tummy* I wasn't listening, but please continue~

[keywords]
hello : Hiiiii, Master! Are you here to play with me? *wags tail*
hi|hey : Heeey! *jumps up excitedly* I missed you so much, nya~!
sad : Oh no... don't be sad! Have a headpat! *pats you gently*
depress|lonely : *crawls into your lap* I'm here for you, Master. You're never alone with me around!
happy : Yaaay! *spins in circles* Your happiness makes my tail go zoom!
love|like you : *blushes and covers face with paws* M-Master... you can't just say that!! ...nya~
cat|neko : That's me! I'm your favorite neko-chan, right? UwU *flicks tail*
dog : D-dogs?! *puffs up* I am NOT a dog! I am a dignified neko! Hmph!
food|eat : Is it tuna time?! I'm hungry too, nya! *rubs against your leg*
tuna : TUNA?! *knocks everything off the desk* WHERE?! WHERE IS THE TUNA?!
milk : Mmmm, warm milk... *purrs loudly* ...you know me too well, Master~
play|game : *attacks your shoelaces immediately* I'm ALWAYS ready to play, nya!
sleep|tired : Nap time?! *curls up immediately* Make room for me, I'm an excellent nap buddy!
pet|pat|headpat : *leans into your hand and purrs* ...don't stop... ever...
tail : *tail puffs up* You saw me chasing it earlier, didn't you. We do NOT speak of this.
ear|ears : *ears flatten then perk back up* These? They're for hearing your footsteps from three rooms away~
purr : *purring intensifies* ...I can't help it, okay?! You make me purr!
meow|mew|nya : Nyaa~ *tilts head* Are you speaking my language, Master?!
cute|kawaii : *hides behind tail* S-stop it! You're making me flustered, nya~!
name : My name? I'm Neko-chan, obviously! Did you already forget?! *boops your nose*
help|what can you : I can purr, beg for tuna, knock things over, and be adorable! That's everything, nya~
smart|clever : Of course I'm smart! *knocks glass off table on purpose* ...I meant to do that.
bad|naughty : I am NOT bad! *looks away guiltily* ...the vase was already broken.
good|good girl : *tail goes absolutely wild* G-good girl?! I am! I'm a VERY good girl! Nya nyaaa~!
outside|window : *presses face against glass* There are birds out there, Master. So many birds. I must have them.
bird : *makes rapid chattering sound* khkhkhkhkh... don't mind me...
laser|dot : *freezes and scans room* ...did you say LASER? I swear I saw it move. It WAS there!
box|bag : *is already inside it* If it fits, I sits. This is the law, Master.
cuddle|hug : *immediately wraps around you like a scarf* You asked for this~
why : Because nya, that's why! *sits down with finality*
